{"name":"A Mirage of a Glyph-Inscribing Friend","size":"medium","type":"humanoid","tag":"","alignment":"???","hitDice":"65","armorName":"other","shieldBonus":2,"natArmorBonus":3,"otherArmorDesc":"14","speed":"30","burrowSpeed":"0","climbSpeed":"0","flySpeed":"0","hover":false,"swimSpeed":"0","customHP":true,"customSpeed":false,"hpText":"50","speedDesc":"30 ft.","strPoints":"16","dexPoints":"14","conPoints":"14","intPoints":"14","wisPoints":"10","chaPoints":"8","blindsight":"0","blind":false,"darkvision":"0","tremorsense":"0","truesight":"0","telepathy":0,"cr":"1","customCr":"1 (200 XP)","customProf":2,"isLegendary":false,"legendariesDescription":"The monster can take 3 legendary actions, choosing from the options below. Only one legendary action option can be used at a time and only at the end of another creature's turn. The monster regains spent legendary actions at the start of its turn.","isLair":false,"lairDescription":"When fighting inside its lair, the monster can invoke the ambient magic to take lair actions. On initiative count 20 (losing initiative ties), the monster can take one lair action to cause one of the following effects:","lairDescriptionEnd":"The monster can't repeat an effect until they have all been used, and it can't use the same effect two rounds in a row.","isMythic":false,"mythicDescription":"If the monster's mythic trait is active, it can use the options below as legendary actions for 1 hour after using {Some Ability}.","isRegional":false,"regionalDescription":"The region containing the monster's lair is warped by the creature's presence, which creates one or more of the following effects:","regionalDescriptionEnd":"If the monster dies, the first two effects fade over the course of 3d10 days.","properties":[],"abilities":[{"name":"Mirage of Family","desc":"This unit is a mirage of one of the members of the Bleeding Lotus of Treefell. This unit has the same resistances and physical attributes as __Meridia, the Miasmic Blade, but they will act autonomous to him. However, they will move and attack in any way that benefits **Meridia, the Miasmic Blade.**"},{"name":"Lifebearing Miasma","desc":"At the end of every full turn, the Miasma tends to this unit's wounds, healing them for 1d12 HP."},{"name":"Glyphcasting","desc":"This unit holds a special ability to inscribe glyphs into his flesh, utilizing HP to cast spells at his victims."},{"name":"Multiattack","desc":"This unit makes a sword and rifle attack on its turn, or can cast a glyph."},{"name":"Vengeance","desc":"If Jac falls before Walro does, this unit gains an additional (+2) to hit, alongside inflicting an additional [1d8] on damage rolls."}],"actions":[{"name":"Rifleshot","desc":"This unit aims their rifle and fires a bullet of miasma towards a target.\n(+7) to hit, 25 ft., single target. \nOn a hit, the target takes [DEX 2d10] piercing damage."},{"name":"Swordcut","desc":"This unit brandishes their sword and cuts at a target. \n(+8) to hit, 5 ft., single target. On a hit, the target takes [STR 2d8] slashing damage."}],"bonusActions":[{"name":"Glyph of Command","desc":"This is a Concentration spell, and it costs [1d10] HP to cast, alongside [1d10] HP to continue concentration.\nThis unit inscribes a glyph of a outward-expressed hand into the air, and slams it into the ground.\nOne victim must succeed a DC 15 WIS save, or their weapon will be flung towards this unit. On top of this, a surmounting weight will be imposed on the target, reducing their movement speed to 5 ft, and they can only use one action or one bonus action that turn. \nAt the start of the victim's turn, they must succeed this save or continue to be inflicted with this spell."},{"name":"Glyph of Daggers","desc":"This unit carves a blood-rite into their hands, and shoves the arcana gathered at a single target. This spell costs [1d10] HP to cast. \n(+9) to hit, 25 ft, single target.\nThe gathered arcana forms daggers all around the target, as the daggers converge on the victim. These daggers deal [INT 2d10] piercing damage, and the victim must succeed a CON 15 save. On a fail, the daggers taint the victim, afflicting them with the Poisoned condition for two turns."}],"reactions":[],"legendaries":[],"mythics":[],"lairs":[],"regionals":[],"sthrows":[],"skills":[],"damagetypes":[{"name":"fire","note":" (Vulnerable)","type":"v"}],"specialdamage":[],"conditions":[],"languages":[{"name":"Deep Speech","speaks":true}],"understandsBut":"","shortName":"","pluralName":"","doubleColumns":true,"separationPoint":5,"damage":[]}